     misc_feature    complement(3121501..3121827)
                     /note="similar to insertion sequence element IS6110
                     transposase(fragment); Putative Transposase for IS6110
                     (fragment). Identical to many other M. tuberculosis IS6110
                     transposase subunits. The transposase described here may
                     be made by a frame shifting mechanism during translation,
                     the sequence UUUUAAAG maybe responsible for such a
                     frameshifting event (see McAdam et al., 1990). This region
                     is a possible MT-complex-specific genomic island (See Becq
                     et al., 2007 PMID:17545187)."
